WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:04.138 --> 00:00:05.906 size:53% position:73% line:53%
véhicules d'occasion, les prix
ont explosé.

00:00:10.077 --> 00:00:11.512 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ceux qui veulent s'acheter
un véhicule neuf doivent

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:17.284 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(bruit de moteur)

00:00:15.783 --> 00:00:18.018 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Il lui a fallu quelques mois

00:00:16.684 --> 00:00:18.786 size:53% position:73% line:53%
